{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f1c2a7e-4b3d-4c8e-9a51-2d7f0e9b1c33",
    "name": "Todo API (FastAPI + JWT)",
    "description": "End-to-end tests for the Todo API.\n\nRun the whole collection in order (Collection > Run). Requests pass data to each other through collection variables:\n\n- **Register** creates a fresh random user (so the collection can be re-run).\n- **Login** saves `access_token`.\n- The collection uses **Bearer {{access_token}}** auth, so every request inherits the token unless it overrides auth.\n- **Create todo** saves `todo_id` for the next requests.\n\nFolders:\n0. Health\n1. Auth: register, login, me, plus the error cases\n2. Todos: full CRUD + filters\n3. Security: missing, invalid or tampered tokens; one user can't touch another user's todos\n4. CORS: preflight from allowed and blocked origins\n\nA collection-level test also checks that the custom middleware headers (X-Request-ID, X-Process-Time) are on every response.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Runs after EVERY request in the collection.",
          "// Preflight (OPTIONS) is answered by CORSMiddleware, the outermost layer,",
          "// so it never reaches our custom middleware - skip those.",
          "if (pm.request.method !== 'OPTIONS') {",
          "    pm.test('[middleware] X-Request-ID header present', () => {",
          "        pm.response.to.have.header('X-Request-ID');",
          "    });",
          "    pm.test('[middleware] X-Process-Time header present', () => {",
          "        pm.response.to.have.header('X-Process-Time');",
          "    });",
          "}",
          "pm.test('Response time under 2s', () => {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "secret123" },
    { "key": "username", "value": "" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "todo_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "todo_id_2", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tampered_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "username_2", "value": "" },
    { "key": "access_token_2", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
